Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain? No way. This ain't rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a... oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a glorious place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag and stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand for\Nthe endless everlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion I believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.21,0:01:31.34,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.21,0:01:31.34,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.68,0:01:43.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.68,0:01:43.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way to the moon's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swaying in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.94,0:01:50.65,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.94,0:01:50.65,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NRaiyan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the\Nother side is, yeah,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.82,0:01:57.91,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.82,0:01:57.91,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah, is what I am for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far from\Nwhere my search began, overseas,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.58,0:02:05.12,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.58,0:02:05.12,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the green end shores of sand, through\Nthe endless everlasting world I've been.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.12,0:02:08.84,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.12,0:02:08.84,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}PhosCity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.80,0:02:15.05,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.80,0:02:15.05,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}EvoWarrior5\NKorvic\Nthemuffinman\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight I will search for everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}arch1t3cht
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.77,0:02:31.65,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\bord1.9\blur0.6\3c&H0F0F0F&\c&H0F0F0F&\fsp-2\1a&HFF&\t(955,1000,\1a&H00&)}Why the Log Pose is Spherical
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.77,0:02:31.65,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\bord0\blur0.6\fsp-2\4a&HFF&}Why the Log Pose is Spherical
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just an awful dream! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think the party's over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.43,0:03:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't stop falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rudder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn the rudder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll never work in these waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you've got to protect the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's taken a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cast aside my worries and reach\Ndeep within to find my happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I open my eyes, this serene\Nlandscape is all that will lay before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A skeleton! Dead guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw that nasty thing at me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if this stuff's gonna stop falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, why did a ship\Njust fall out of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Error, the sky's clear, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew coming to the\NGrand Line was a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It freaks me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose is broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointing into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose registers an island\Nwith a strong magnetic pull,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and its needle is reflecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the needle is pointing toward the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it must be pointing\Ntoward Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a floating island up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is one, then it's full of\Nskeletons and rickety-hole ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything but sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an island above us,\Nbut an entire ocean. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and set\Nour course for Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, are we ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put the rudder down and point\Nthe bow high into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skyward ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it just hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that, you know,\Nwe can't fly and all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, all I know about\NSky Island is word of mouth. Rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never actually seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not, because it's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Islands don't float in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Log Pose is broken, that's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:04:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to fix something\Nthat's not even broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be trying to find\Na way to get to Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really need to learn\Nto trust your instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how crazy things get or how weird\Nthe situation is we find ourselves in,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never doubt the Log Pose\Nout here on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the most\Nsteadfast and unbreakable rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we should be doubting is\Nthe common sense we all have that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tells us an island cannot exist\Nin the sky on an ocean of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That needle is pointing toward an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my life on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting. Digging\Nthrough a dead man's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really going to tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're into some pretty\Nweird stuff, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any lady with a fascination for dead\Nthings is interesting in my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd Luffy go? Okay. Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of trouble are those\Ntwo getting themselves into now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably the bad kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, looks good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for the holes on the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those came from an external source.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it could have been\Narrows or a spear or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are from a medical\Nprocedure called craterization.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ancient one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They cut out a small hole in the skull\Nto remove a foreign mass like a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since it leaves the crater\Nbehind, that's how you get the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing how old of a technique this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say this man has been\Ndead at least 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can also say with confidence\Nthis man was in his early
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30s when he died. It must have\Nbeen during his voyage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he finally succumbed to the\Nillness whatever it was much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than the rest of his\Nbones his teeth have remained
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in surprisingly good condition\Nbecause he rubbed tar on
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them it was a common practice\Nin the south blue to keep out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bacterial infections and\Nconsidering the history of that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,region i'd suspect that he\Nwas with an exploratory party
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here it is the bris\Nkingdom of the south blue
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They launched the Saint\NBriss as a scout ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,208 years ago that's it that's\Nthe ship that fell on us yeah i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,recognize that figurehead out\Nfront it's probably sailed the seas
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,above us unmanned since the captain\Nand crew died it's amazing what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can tell from looking at old\Nbones i'm sure you've heard that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.29,0:07:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead men tell no tales. Right,\Nbut everything around them does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this was a scouting party we\Nshould find evidence of that on the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saint Bris, yeah. Except it's sinking\Nlike a stone. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it i did it i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found the most incredible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A map of the Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Skypiea? That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's true, there really\Nis an island up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to journey up the Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know how to get there\Nor if it's even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention there are a lot of\Nfake treasure maps in circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, sure it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be because,\Nwell, just because.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the fact is, that map doesn't\Ntell us how to find the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, do you mind\Nnot punching the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put a lot of work into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Nami is a vision even when\Nshe's chewing someone's head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy, Nami, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the reality is that\Nwe know next to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we do know is that we can't\Ndefy gravity and sail upwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we need is more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a big ship like that made it up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the odds are we\Ncan do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:09:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to find all the\Nrecords left on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the ship's at the\Nbottom of the ocean by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it sunk, we'll salvage it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.79,0:09:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we couldn't pull\Na ship up from the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they'll have to come\Nup with a more refined plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I've done more dangerous\Nthings, but I can't remember what...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I swear to find you the answers\Nyou seek or I will refuse to return!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those barrels are my special design.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've never been busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be pulling for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Chopper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guys call off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Luffy and there's a\Nton of monsters down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on a nest of giant sea snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they're staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Chopper, hold that\Nbrake tightly. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad they didn't make me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salvage the sea, salvage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,salvage the sea, salvage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,salvage the sea, salvage,\Nsalvage the sea, salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we on top of the place\Nwhere the ships sank?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye aye captain sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they say captain\Nand sir, they're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about me prepare to\Nrace the ship what lies
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.00,0:11:08.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord15\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur15\4a&H80&\fsp1\fad(470,470)\pos(720,581.8)\fs90\fscx85\fscy85}"Salvage King" Masira\NMasira Pirates\NBounty: 23 Million Belly
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.00,0:11:08.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,470)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord0\blur0.5\fsp1\pos(720,581.8)\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\c&HFEFFFD&}"Salvage King" Masira\NMasira Pirates\NBounty: 23 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the bottom now belongs to the king of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all salvagers captain\Nof the marshada pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, a boat of unstable men\Nled by an unstable monkey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you guys doing here in\Ncase you didn't know all these
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waters belong to me they do\Nyeah that's right every vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that sinks in these parts\Nautomatically becomes mine you're
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not trying to take something\Nthat belongs to me are you so
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's going to bring it to the\Nsurface easier for us but not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the three guys already in\Nthe water we should just keep
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our mouth shut and let him do\Nit stop mumbling and answer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me are you people trying to\Nyank one of my salvages out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From under me, excuse me, can I\Nask you a question first? You've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got questions for me fine sure\Nwhatever ask me anything are
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of you tough good-looking\Nmen gonna salvage that ship
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:12:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what thank you i see you know\Nwhat a real man looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about you\Ncalled us all tough and good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.07,0:12:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-looking that includes me well\Nof course stop you're making me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blush this is disturbing so are\Nyou gonna salvage that thing or
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the king of all\Nsalvagers for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a sunken ship before\Nme, then I'll salvage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not sunken, then I'll\Nsink it and salvage it later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know how impressed you\Nare, but we have to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's salvaging at hand! Loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if we watch\Nyou, big strong man, work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never seen\Na professional salvage before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just watch us till\Nyour heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to wait\Nand see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below, in the water, there's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something happened to the guys who\Nwent into the water to set the cradle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it one of those sea kings again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.85,0:12:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like someone went to\Ntown on them with their fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean someone else besides\Nour guys are down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone else down\Nthere, so be careful! Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want all hands setting the cradle\Nthe ship comes up in 20 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got salvaging to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's waving at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smile and wave back, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just act normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get stage-fried, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're observers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want to see something new,\Nso show them how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're still nervous, try\Npicturing them in their underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:13:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop the cradle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes peeled for those intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys really take their\Nsalvaging seriously, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they're showing off because\Ntheir captain has a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want this done fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cradle set is locked in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so why such a big monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.49,0:16:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, on the bow of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a special prow I designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't in our salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lower the Brook, hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Completely amazing! Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forty meters to the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brook hunter joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually going to use his\Nbreath to bring up that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a bubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The body of the ship is off the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, howlera!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hustle, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send more air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, there's a problem\Nwith the underwater crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it the intruders? Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're in the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you lay a hand\Non my hard-working men?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you know, we're not going to\Ntake your picture or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was giving us a photo op?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue with the\Nsalvaging operation, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The salvage looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even need the barrels now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know how they pumped\Nthis much air into a downed ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what I really want\Nto know is who they are
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and why they're trying\Nto salvage this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if something bad happened\Nto Nami and Robin up on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've tried calling them,\Nbut they won't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you guys think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to muscle in on my turf?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.57,0:19:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I feel it adds a\Nrefined quality to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, certainly adds something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he means to say is who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. How rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I get caught up\Nin the details of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of my shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just tell us who you are already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody just want to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all you guys from the East\NBlue have the best sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really know about all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing compares to a\None-ton gorilla in makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:21:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else see the monster the\Nsize of an island in front of us?

